COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."request_date" IS '[Optional] When the referral was requested. Request-to-receipt lag. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."received_date" IS '[Optional] When the referral arrived. If the source does not send it: Valid-from date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."valid_from" IS '[Important] First date the referral covers. If the source does not send it: Received date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."valid_to" IS '[Important] Last date the referral covers. Expiry warnings. If the source does not send it: Valid-from plus the payer''s usual period';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."visits_allowed" IS '[Important] Visits approved. If the source does not send it: Blank means unlimited within dates';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."visits_used" IS '[Important] Visits already used. Visits remaining = allowed - used. If the source does not send it: Count of completed appointments inside the dates';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."diagnosis_code_id" IS '[Optional] Diagnosis on the referral. If the source does not send it: Blank';
