COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."authorization_id" IS '[Optional] Linked authorization, when the plan needs both. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."document_id" IS '[Important] The signed referral document (metadata row). If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "referral"."version" IS '[Mandatory] 1 for the first row; higher for each change. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
