COMMENT ON TABLE "appointment_details" IS '[Optional] [1 Appointment] One row is: One row per service planned for the appointment. Why: What is expected at the visit. Optional: most schedulers hold an appointment type, not a procedure. Where missing, a typical code is inferred and marked.';
