COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."appointment_id" IS '[Mandatory] Ties the planned service to its appointment. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."line_number" IS '[Mandatory] Position within the appointment. If the source does not send it: Order in the feed';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."practice_id" IS '[Important] Copied from the header, so reports by practice never join up. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."patient_id" IS '[Important] Copied from the header. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."payer_id" IS '[Important] Copied from the header, as of this stage. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."provider_id" IS '[Important] Copied from the header. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."specialty_id" IS '[Optional] Copied from the provider''s specialty; fast specialty reports. If the source does not send it: From the provider';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."planned_cpt_code_id" IS '[Important] Drives the authorization check, patient estimate and eligibility service type. If the source does not send it: Typical code for the appointment type (inferred)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."is_inferred" IS '[Mandatory] Whether the planned code was given or guessed, so a guess is never treated as known. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."planned_units" IS '[Important] Units for the estimate. If the source does not send it: 1';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."expected_charge" IS '[Important] Units x the fee list; estimate and forecast. If the source does not send it: Fee list, else payer''s typical charge';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."expected_allowed" IS '[Important] Contract rate; estimates the patient''s share. If the source does not send it: Payer''s typical allowed amount';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."auth_required" IS '[Important] Yes, no, unknown. Unknown is never read as no. If the source does not send it: Unknown';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."authorization_id" IS '[Optional] Authorization on file. If the source does not send it: Match on patient, code, dates';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."planned_diagnosis_code_id" IS '[Optional] Some referrals and authorizations need it. If the source does not send it: Patient''s recent diagnoses';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."planned_provider_id" IS '[Optional] When a different provider performs the service. If the source does not send it: Appointment''s provider';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."room_or_equipment" IS '[Optional] Capacity planning. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."duration_minutes" IS '[Optional] Slot length. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."source" IS '[Mandatory] Where the row came from: feed, API, PM export, rebuilt from another record. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."is_reconstructed" IS '[Mandatory] 1 if the row was rebuilt from other data, so reports can mark it less reliable. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."known_at" IS '[Mandatory] When the data became known (point in time). If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_details"."loaded_at" IS '[Mandatory] When the row was loaded. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
