COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_slot"."slot_type" IS '[Important] New_patient, follow_up, procedure, telehealth, any, block. If the source does not send it: Any';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "appointment_slot"."appointment_id" IS '[Important] The appointment filling the slot. If the source does not send it: Match on provider, date, time';
