COMMENT ON COLUMN "claim"."accident_related" IS '[Optional] Accident indicator; some specialties. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "claim"."referral_provider_id" IS '[Optional] Referral; some specialties. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "claim"."batch_control_number" IS '[Optional] Matches 999 and 277CA acknowledgements. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "claim"."signature_on_file" IS '[Optional] [NEW IN REVIEW] Y, N or U (unknown): the provider''s signature is on file, as the 837 states. If the source does not send it: Unknown (U)';
