COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."line_status" IS '[Mandatory] Drafted, held, ready, claimed, patient_billed, written_off, voided. Worked out, not typed. If the source does not send it: From whether a claim line exists';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."service_date" IS '[Important] Per-line date. If the source does not send it: Bill date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."modifier_1_id" IS '[Important] Final billed modifier. If the source does not send it: From the encounter line';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."modifier_2_id" IS '[Important] Second modifier. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."modifier_3_id" IS '[Important] Third modifier. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."modifier_4_id" IS '[Important] Fourth modifier. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."diagnosis_1_id" IS '[Important] Final supporting diagnosis. If the source does not send it: Encounter line''s';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."diagnosis_2_id" IS '[Optional] Second diagnosis. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."diagnosis_3_id" IS '[Optional] Third diagnosis. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."diagnosis_4_id" IS '[Optional] Fourth diagnosis. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."rendering_provider_id" IS '[Important] When different from the bill. If the source does not send it: Bill''s provider';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."encounter_detail_id" IS '[Important] Performed-to-billed traceability; missed-charge detection. If the source does not send it: Match on visit, code, date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "bill_details"."charge_entered_date" IS '[Important] Detects late charges. If the source does not send it: The bill''s entered date';
