COMMENT ON COLUMN "claim_status_history"."clearinghouse_batch_number" IS '[Optional] Batch the claim travelled in. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "claim_status_history"."source" IS '[Mandatory] Where the row came from: feed, API, PM export, rebuilt from another record. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
