COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."payments_patient" IS '[Important] Movement split. If the source does not send it: Total only';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."adjustments_contractual" IS '[Important] Movement split. If the source does not send it: Total only';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."adjustments_denial" IS '[Important] Movement split. If the source does not send it: Total only';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."adjustments_other" IS '[Important] Movement split. If the source does not send it: Total only';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."transfers_to_patient" IS '[Important] Moved from payer to patient. If the source does not send it: Total only';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."transfers_to_secondary" IS '[Important] Moved to a secondary payer. If the source does not send it: Total only';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."claim_id" IS '[Important] Current claim. If the source does not send it: Match on charge line';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."claim_detail_id" IS '[Important] Current claim line. If the source does not send it: Match on charge line';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."claim_status" IS '[Important] Status at period end. If the source does not send it: From the claim';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."payer_id" IS '[Important] Payer responsible at period end. If the source does not send it: Copied from the charge';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."open_denied_amount" IS '[Important] Denial-related AR. If the source does not send it: From denial';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."is_in_denial" IS '[Important] An open denial exists. If the source does not send it: From denial';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."expected_collectible" IS '[Important] Net AR: contract expected minus paid. If the source does not send it: Balance x historical collection rate (assumed)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."last_payment_date" IS '[Important] Stalled accounts. If the source does not send it: From the ledger';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."last_activity_date" IS '[Important] Stalled accounts. If the source does not send it: From the ledger';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."last_statement_date" IS '[Important] Statement timing. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."is_credit" IS '[Important] Closing below zero: refund candidates. If the source does not send it: Derived';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."ledger_balance" IS '[Important] Ledger sum to period end (visible check). If the source does not send it: Always computed by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."variance_amount" IS '[Important] Closing minus ledger. If the source does not send it: Always computed by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."is_restated" IS '[Important] Rebuilt after a backdated posting. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."period_status" IS '[Important] Open or closed. If the source does not send it: Open';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."provider_id" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."specialty_id" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."cpt_code_id" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."facility_id" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."service_date" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."collections_agency_flag" IS '[Optional] Placed with a collections agency. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."statement_count" IS '[Optional] Statements sent. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."version" IS '[Mandatory] 1 for the first row; higher for each change. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."is_current" IS '[Mandatory] 1 on the latest version. Counts use current rows only. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."previous_ar_interval_id" IS '[Important] Internal ID of the version this row replaced. Following this chain decodes every cancellation, reschedule or replacement. If the source does not send it: Blank on the first version';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."replaced_date" IS '[Important] Date this version was replaced or ended. If the source does not send it: Blank while current';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."source" IS '[Mandatory] Where the row came from: feed, API, PM export, rebuilt from another record. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."is_reconstructed" IS '[Mandatory] 1 if the row was rebuilt from other data, so reports can mark it less reliable. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar_interval"."known_at" IS '[Mandatory] When the data became known (point in time). If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
