COMMENT ON TABLE "ar" IS '[Mandatory] [4 Transactions, denials, AR] One row is: One row per open balance, per owner (payer, patient, unbilled), per as-of date. Why: The position at a date. Daily for 90 days, weekly for 13 months, month-end forever. Month-end rows are frozen as reported. Reconciles to ar_interval at period end.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."ar_id" IS '[Mandatory] Internal identity ID. Every join and link between tables uses this, so the client''s number never has to be shown or masked in analytics. If the source does not send it: Generated by us';
