COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."snapshot_type" IS '[Mandatory] Daily, weekly, month_end. If the source does not send it: Daily';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."snapshot_run_id" IS '[Mandatory] The run that wrote the row. A rerun replaces its own date atomically, so no duplicates. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."bill_id" IS '[Mandatory] The account''s visit. If the source does not send it: Via the claim';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."balance_owner" IS '[Mandatory] Payer, patient or unbilled. If the source does not send it: Responsible party on the ledger';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."balance" IS '[Mandatory] Open amount for that owner. If the source does not send it: Sum of transactions to the date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."practice_id" IS '[Mandatory] Reports by practice. If the source does not send it: Copied from the bill';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."patient_id" IS '[Mandatory] Patient accounts. If the source does not send it: Copied from the bill';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."aging_date" IS '[Mandatory] When this row''s clock started. If the source does not send it: Date of service';
