COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."aging_bucket" IS '[Mandatory] Current, 0-30, 31-60, 61-90, 91-120, 120+. If the source does not send it: Computed';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."aging_basis" IS '[Mandatory] What the clock started from. If the source does not send it: Date of service';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."claim_id" IS '[Important] The claim on payer rows; blank for unbilled and self-pay. If the source does not send it: Match on charge line';
