COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."submitted_date" IS '[Important] Date sent. If the source does not send it: From the claim';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."expected_collectible" IS '[Important] Net AR. If the source does not send it: Balance x historical collection rate (assumed)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."last_payment_date" IS '[Important] Stalled accounts. If the source does not send it: From the ledger';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."last_activity_date" IS '[Important] Stalled accounts. If the source does not send it: From the ledger';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."days_since_activity" IS '[Important] Follow-up queue. If the source does not send it: Computed';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."last_statement_date" IS '[Important] Patient statement timing. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."open_denied_amount" IS '[Important] Denial-related AR. If the source does not send it: From denial';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."is_in_denial" IS '[Important] Open denial exists. If the source does not send it: From denial';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."is_credit" IS '[Important] Balance below zero. If the source does not send it: Derived';
