COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."specialty_id" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."facility_id" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."service_date" IS '[Important] Copied. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."primary_cpt_code_id" IS '[Optional] Procedure view. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "ar"."change_since_last_snapshot" IS '[Optional] Trend. If the source does not send it: Blank';
