COMMENT ON COLUMN "patient_statement"."payment_plan_id" IS '[Optional] The payment plan the patient is on, if any. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "patient_statement"."version" IS '[Mandatory] 1 for the first row; higher for each change. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
