COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."is_current" IS '[Important] 1 on the latest decision for the entity and type. If the source does not send it: 1';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."task_id" IS '[Important] The task raised from it. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."finding_id" IS '[Important] The finding behind it. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."input_hash" IS '[Optional] Hash of the inputs, so a replay can prove it saw the same data. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."practice_id" IS '[Important] Reports by practice. If the source does not send it: From the entity the agent worked on';
