COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."payer_id" IS '[Important] Reports by payer. If the source does not send it: From the entity';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."provider_id" IS '[Important] Reports by provider. If the source does not send it: From the entity';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."specialty_id" IS '[Important] Reports by specialty. If the source does not send it: From the provider';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."appointment_id" IS '[Important] The appointment concerned, when there is one. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."encounter_id" IS '[Important] The visit concerned. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."bill_id" IS '[Important] The bill concerned. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."claim_id" IS '[Important] The claim concerned. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."denial_id" IS '[Important] The denial concerned. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."authorization_id" IS '[Important] The authorization concerned. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_decision"."recheck_condition" IS '[Optional] [NEW IN REVIEW] What must be true for this decision to count as closed (for example task done and the rules pass again). If the source does not send it: Blank';
