COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."agent_code" IS '[Mandatory] Which agent, A1 to A15. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."agent_name" IS '[Important] Display name. If the source does not send it: From the code';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."run_mode" IS '[Mandatory] Shadow (proposals only), assisted or live. If the source does not send it: Shadow';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."trigger_type" IS '[Mandatory] Schedule, event, manual, retry. If the source does not send it: Schedule';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."started_at" IS '[Mandatory] Start time. If the source does not send it: First decision time';
