COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."is_reconstructed" IS '[Mandatory] 1 if the row was rebuilt from other data, so reports can mark it less reliable. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."known_at" IS '[Mandatory] When the data became known (point in time). If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_run"."loaded_at" IS '[Mandatory] When the row was loaded. If the source does not send it: Always set by us';
