COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."forecast_type" IS '[Mandatory] Cash_week, cash_28d, cash_later, claim_week_chance, recoverable_month. If the source does not send it: Cash_week';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."as_of_date" IS '[Mandatory] Date the forecast was made. Each day''s forecast is kept, so later scoring uses what was known then. If the source does not send it: Run date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."target_start_date" IS '[Mandatory] First day of the period predicted. If the source does not send it: As-of date';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."target_end_date" IS '[Mandatory] Last day of the period predicted. For cash_later, as-of date plus 365 days. If the source does not send it: Start plus 6 days';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."expected_amount" IS '[Mandatory] Expected dollars in the period (chance times balance for one claim). If the source does not send it: From the model';
