COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."claim_count" IS '[Important] Open claims behind the row. If the source does not send it: Counted';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."practice_id" IS '[Important] Reports by practice. If the source does not send it: Client default';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."payer_id" IS '[Important] Forecast by payer; blank for all payers. If the source does not send it: Blank';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "agent_forecast"."entity_type" IS '[Important] Claim for a claim chance; practice or payer for a total. If the source does not send it: Practice';
