COMMENT ON COLUMN "payer_rule"."owner_role" IS '[Important] Team that fixes a failure of this rule: registration, authorization, coding, billing. If the source does not send it: billing';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "payer_rule"."severity" IS '[Important] Block or warn when the rule fails. If the source does not send it: warn';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "payer_rule"."is_enabled" IS '[Mandatory] Switch. A disabled rule is skipped and the skip is logged. If the source does not send it: 1';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "payer_rule"."is_synthetic" IS '[Mandatory] 1 for a placeholder rule used for demos or tests; kept out of real results. If the source does not send it: 0';
